      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## QuantFunc MiniMax-H3\n\nQuantFunc runs the H3 transformer and joint video/audio sampling. CLIPLoader (type minimax), the VAEs, scheduler and sampler are stock ComfyUI; Stage 2 uses the QuantFunc conditioning reuse node.\n\n- Transformer: `minimax_h3_ref2va_8steps_quantfunc_int4_r128.safetensors`, from [QuantFunc on ModelScope](https://modelscope.cn/models/QuantFunc/Minimax-H3-Quantfunc-4bit), in models/diffusion_models.\n- Text encoder: `qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors`. Video VAE: `minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors`. Audio VAE: `minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors`, from [Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3).\n- Saved canvas: 768x768, 124 frames.\n- Saved sampling: 8 total steps, res_multistep / simple, denoise 1, attention sage.\n- Saved seed: 42 (fixed).\n- References: `ComfyUI_temp_tupev_00031_.png` is active; `mecha_dragon_lightning.png` is bypassed.\n- Reference sizing: match. The active image is `<Picture 1>` in the prompt; connect more references in order as needed.\n\n**Two stages on one schedule.** Stage 1 runs 3 steps at 768x768; Stage 2 continues the remaining 5 steps at 1152x1152. The upscale node scales Stage 1's denoised video latent by 1.5 using nearest-exact, keeps the audio latent, and outputs the Stage 2 width/height. Stage 2 adds noise at the split sigma and continues the same schedule.\n\nSet the low-res size in Stage 1 conditioning and the scale in the latent upscale node. Stage 2 reads the computed size; its unused empty latent output does not feed the sampler. Edit the prompt and frame count once, in Prompt and Length (frames).\n\n**Stage 2 conditioning reuse.** Stage 2 keeps Stage 1 Qwen text/vision embeddings and token tags, avoiding a second Qwen encode. The stock H3 logic rebuilds reference VAE conditions (match sizing) at the Stage 2 size.\nThis deliberately retains the Stage 1 Qwen visual representation; it is not equivalent to re-encoding the 1152x1152 reference image in Qwen.\naudio_enhance is unsupported for double sampling and is ignored for this run.\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## QuantFunc MiniMax-H3\n\nQuantFunc runs the H3 transformer and joint video/audio sampling. CLIPLoader (type minimax), the VAEs, scheduler and sampler are stock ComfyUI; Stage 2 uses the QuantFunc conditioning reuse node.\n\n- Transformer: `minimax_h3_ref2va_8steps_quantfunc_int4_r128.safetensors`, from [QuantFunc on ModelScope](https://modelscope.cn/models/QuantFunc/Minimax-H3-Quantfunc-4bit), in models/diffusion_models.\n- Text encoder: `qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors`. Video VAE: `minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors`. Audio VAE: `minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors`, from [Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3).\n- Saved canvas: 768x768, 124 frames.\n- Saved sampling: 8 total steps, res_multistep / simple, denoise 1, attention sage.\n- Saved seed: 42 (fixed).\n- References: `ComfyUI_temp_tupev_00031_.png` is active; `mecha_dragon_lightning.png` is bypassed.\n- Reference sizing: match. The active image is `<Picture 1>` in the prompt; connect more references in order as needed.\n\n**Two stages on one schedule.** Stage 1 runs 3 steps at 768x768; Stage 2 continues the remaining 5 steps at 1152x1152. The upscale node scales Stage 1's denoised video latent by 1.5 using nearest-exact, keeps the audio latent, and outputs the Stage 2 width/height. Stage 2 adds noise at the split sigma and continues the same schedule.\n\nSet the low-res size in Stage 1 conditioning and the scale in the latent upscale node. Stage 2 reads the computed size; its unused empty latent output does not feed the sampler. Edit the prompt and frame count once, in Prompt and Length (frames).\n\n**Stage 2 conditioning reuse.** Stage 2 keeps Stage 1 Qwen text/vision embeddings and token tags, avoiding a second Qwen encode. The stock H3 logic rebuilds reference VAE conditions (match sizing) at the Stage 2 size.\nThis deliberately retains the Stage 1 Qwen visual representation; it is not equivalent to re-encoding the 1152x1152 reference image in Qwen.\naudio_enhance is unsupported for double sampling and is ignored for this run.\n"
      },
      "color": "#432",
